    "text": "Hints: \\(x+\\frac{1}{x}=2 \\cos \\theta\\)\nLet \\(x=\\cos \\theta+1 \\sin \\theta\\)\n\\(\\frac{1}{x}=\\cos \\theta-1 \\sin \\theta\\)\nThus \\(x^n+\\frac{1}{x^n}=2 \\cos n \\theta\\)",
